Package: lsar
Title: Weighted Estimation and Disclosure Control for the lsa-platform Demo
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jake", "Stephan", email = "jake@stephan-j.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analysis functions for the synthetic assessment data of the
    lsa-platform demonstration project: design-weighted estimation over
    plausible values and small-cell suppression before publication. Reads
    from the project's PostgreSQL database. All data is synthetic.
